@startuml SD06_Admin_ChangeUserPermission_Fixed
hide footbox
title SD06 Admin Changes User Permission

actor "SystemAdminUser" as AdminUser
participant "App : ShopRentalApplication" as App <<Boundary>>
participant "SystemAdmin : SystemAdmin" as Admin

AdminUser -> App: 1. Change user permission
activate App

App -> App: 2. prompt for userId & permission
App -> Admin: 3. changeUserPermission(userId, permission)
activate Admin
Admin --> App: updated internal state
deactivate Admin

App -> App: 4. saveStateQuietly()
App --> AdminUser: 5. "Permission updated and saved"
deactivate App
@enduml